# The verified per-platform assemblies (lib/<rid>/MTShared.dll, LiteNetLib.dll)
# are committed: the pinned MoonTrader builds are not published on the CDN, so a
# download-on-build restore would 404. fetch_vendor_libs.py finds the committed,
# SHA-verified pair and skips the download. Only the large archive cache is
# ignored — it is re-downloadable (once/if the archives are published) and never
# needs to live in git.
/.cache/
